    },
    {
      "text": "Once the cheese is mixed together well, add in the buffalo hot sauce and shredded chicken. Stir well to combine.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buffalo-chicken-dip/#wprm-recipe-53469-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Low-carb-buffalo-chicken-dip-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the ranch dressing, jalapeno, and half of the green onion. Mix again until well incorporated.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-buffalo-chicken-dip/#wprm-recipe-53469-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Low-carb-buffalo-chicken-dip-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue cooking, stirring occasionally, until mixture is hot. Serve into an insulated serving dish that can keep warm. Top with remaining green onion and (optionally) blue cheese crumbles.",
